# Build-context root for the collector image (see argox-collector/Dockerfile,
# built with context `argox-project/` and `-f argox-collector/Dockerfile`).
#
# Docker/BuildKit reads .dockerignore only from the context ROOT, so this file —
# not argox-collector/.dockerignore — governs what the cloud build (az acr build)
# uploads. Only argox-core/ and argox-collector/ sources are needed; everything
# else, MOST IMPORTANTLY local secrets in .env, must stay out of the context.

# Local secrets and environment files
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# VCS metadata
.git
.gitignore

# Python caches and build artifacts
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.egg-info
**/build
**/dist

# Virtual environments
**/.venv
**/venv
**/env

# Local data and runtime output
**/var
.benchmarks
benchmarks

# Sibling packages not needed by the collector image
argox-exporters
argox-plugins
examples
docs

# Docs and tests are never copied into the image
**/*.md
**/tests
